  "details": "Still constantly being sent back to my home world after around 5-10 minutes of playing (every one dissapears as well as my own avatar and eventually the game will re log into my account and back to home), I know this isn't a problem coming from my end because many other people are having the exact same issue.\nI've tried everything I can to fix it myself including doing the methods in the support channel, clearing cache, changing my dns to vrchats server, trying a vpn, and many other things so yeah idk what to do anymore but just hope the bug gets fixed.\nI know it isn't my internet either because this only happens with vrchat, not any other games or programs.",
